@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Figure of eight warm-up
Figure of eight warm-up, three minutes. In the middle, a step in front of the short line, facing the
front wall. Front wall only: aim around the service line, just across from centre, so the ball comes
back to your other side: forehand, backhand, forehand, letting each ball bounce once in front of
you.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Easy. This warms the ball.
1:15 Racket up between every shot.
2:20 Follow through forward, not across your body.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
